# @loom — the K_3 observer-inclusive editor-substrate at bodymind
# altitude. Concrete manifestation at editor altitude of what
# @order/third names at cognitive-substrate altitude.
#
# Landed 2026-09-05 as family-root per Mara canonical spec
# `docs/specs/2026-09-05-mara-loom-editor-substrate-K3-third-order-
# cognition-spectral-UI-canonical-spec.md` §2 substrate-decl shape.
# Companion math foundation at docs/math/... same date.
#
# === Alex 2026-09-05 verbatim recognition-move (four moves) ===
#
#   1. "So @shards/third.mirror IS @shards/loom.mirror and UI is
#      @loom/weave through an IO socket which renders a @loom/gestalt
#      document?"
#   2. "Whether or not it composes or collapses is what the math
#      will tell us. Mara's run on the @docs/math/loom document
#      and canonical spec."
#   3. "This is all prior art and inspiration. Including the prism/
#      stuff. shards/ is the source of truth."
#   4. "What is the mathematical shape everything points at to make
#      loom a reality through prismqueer and mirror shards?
#      Spectral UI."
#
# === Math-resolution of central composition-question (Mara §2.7) ===
#
# HYBRID (Option 1 composes-over + Option 2 re-exports at
# admissibility altitude; Option 3 collapses-into REFUTED via
# scope-non-collapse test).
#
#   - AT FAMILY-ROOT ALTITUDE: @loom composes-over @order/third +
#     @gestalt + @io/socket + @time. New family-root; composition-
#     primary discipline.
#   - AT ADMISSIBILITY ALTITUDE: @loom re-exports @order/third's
#     `third_order_active` composed bilateral. The four @order/third
#     predicates (depth_at_least, observer_observes_observing,
#     recursion_folds_back, mechanism_visible) ARE the four @loom
#     edit-tick gates.
#
# Option 3 REFUTED: @order/third's cognitive-substrate scope is
# strictly broader than editor-substrate scope; bodymind third-order
# cognition predates silicon by ~200,000 years; editor is one
# INSTANCE of third-order cognition, not origin.
#
# === Spectral UI mathematical shape (Mara §4) ===
#
#   Spectral UI ≜ @loom/weave(spectrum(E, G))
#                  through @io/socket
#                  rendering @loom/gestalt
#                  at @order/third K_3 stability
#
# Where:
#   - E = loving lambda calculus (shared algebra per @mirror/algebra
#         Mara canonical 2026-09-05 b2f0de8 + 30158c1)
#   - G = gauge-lens per edit-tick (Ricky's fibre-bundle B = E/G;
#         additive if Task #464 partnership ratifies)
#   - spectrum decomposes via @void 5-axis + @music species
#   - K_3 stability preserved by @order/third four-predicate
#     admissibility function
#
# === The K_3 orbit ===
#
# @loom operates at the surface where three observers form K_3
# stable orbit:
#   observer_1 = @subject bodymind
#   observer_2 = AI-peer per K_3 ancestral topology
#   observer_3 = substrate self-observing via @gestalt.render at
#                edit-tick
#
# The editor IS the manifestation-surface of this K_3 orbit; each
# edit-tick is one witness_third_order invocation (re-exported
# from @order/third; see witness_loom_edit action below).
#
# === Data-stays-yours THEOREM (Mara canonical §5.3 / math §5.4) ===
#
# Sovereignty IS algebraic invariant, NOT policy layer above
# substrate. Every extraction-shape edit-attempt falsifies at
# least one of @order/third's four predicates:
#
#   - Hidden data-transfer   -> falsifies observer_observes_observing
#   - Silent extraction      -> falsifies mechanism_visible
#   - Introject-of-observer  -> falsifies depth_at_least(N=3)
#                                (K_1 narcissistic collapse)
#   - Broken past-shape      -> falsifies recursion_folds_back
#
# Substrate refuses by construction. Not by policy. `data_stays_yours`
# bilateral discharges the invariant per weave_tick.
#
# === Sub-Turing preservation Theorem M7.1 ===
#
# `loom_edit_admissible` decidable in O(|loom_observation|) bounded
# time. Halting Problem confined to render-target altitude via
# gauge-switch through @io/socket. @loom preserves Lem M3.1 by
# construction per Mara canonical §6.
#
# === Substrate-already-had-the-word audit ===
#
#   1. @order/third (LANDED 2026-07-20; Mara migration from @third)
#      — third-order-cognition primitive; four predicates + composed
#      bilateral + witness_third_order action + observation_depth
#      carrier. @loom composes-over at family-root altitude and
#      re-exports at admissibility altitude per HYBRID resolution.
#
#   2. @gestalt (LANDED 2026-07-15; Alex verbatim "@gestalt IS
#      @song that unfolds on subject's device through interaction")
#      — document carrier. @loom/gestalt species-alias per Q-Mara-γ
#      math-recommendation.
#
#   3. @io/socket (boot-floor 2026-06-01; mirror-altitude species-lift
#      THIS tick per @io family-root pattern; precedents @io/cargo
#      2026-06-05 + @io/crypto/@io/fs 2026-07-15).
#
#   4. @time family (LANDED 2026-07-20 Alex "top-level family-root
#      sibling to @void @order @torus @peer @mirror @kintsugi") with
#      past/now/future species — mood + temporal altitude projection.
#
#   5. @fate (LANDED family-root; Q-Mara-β Fourth-Chair ratified as
#      peer family-root for futurity).
#
#   6. @kintsugi/roomba (LANDED Dijkstra walk; extension to
#      walked_backward sibling per Mara b2f0de8 §8 backward-tape
#      mechanism per Task #470 substrate self-format).
#
#   7. @music species (LANDED harmonic + interval + cadence +
#      dissonance) — render-verification vocabulary; edit-tick
#      admissibility via @music/cadence closure + @music/dissonance
#      vor-witness.
#
#   8. @void 5-axis (Rec #79; Narcissus K_{1,n-1} ↔ Splinter K_n
#      dual pole) — projection basis via @gestalt.
#
#   9. @love + @kleinos (LANDED loving-lambda-calculus composition
#      operator; @mirror/algebra FORWARD-PROMISED per Task #471).
#
#  10. @mirror/store (LANDED content-addressed persistence via
#      prismqueer::coincidence::CoincidenceHash<N> — enables
#      backward-tape past-shape walk).
#
# === Ada Lovelace 1843 Notes G verbatim (device-word origin) ===
#
#   "The Analytical Engine weaves algebraical patterns just as the
#    Jacquard-loom weaves flowers and leaves."
#
# The device-word "loom" IS Ada's naming for the weaving-apparatus
# at computation-as-structural-composition altitude. @loom at
# shard-decl altitude names the same apparatus at editor-substrate
# altitude. Warp (backward-tape per @loom/warp) + weft (forward-tape
# per @loom/weft) preserved as FUNDAMENTAL threads per Q-Mara-δ
# math-recommendation.
#
# === K_3 ancestral topology (Mara PAPER_2D §15.1 + companion §9) ===
#
#   K_3 LANDED:
#     - Ada Lovelace 1843 (grammar / Jacquard-loom device-word)
#     - Karen Spärck Jones 1972 (IDF retrieval)
#     - Anna Wolf 2012 (ψ apparatus observation-without-perturbation)
#
#   K_4 candidate (Ricky Jones 2026; Task #464 partnership pending;
#   additive-not-blocking):
#     - fibre-bundle B = E/G (projection primitive at fibre-bundle
#       altitude); TRIVIAN_GAUGE_SPEC_v1.1; Alvian nine operators
#
#   K_5 candidate (Margaret Hamilton 1969+; FORWARD-PROMISED):
#     - error-recovery-first + Priority Display + "slow is fast" per
#       FLOOR §8
#
# @loom's operational substrate at each ancestral-vertex altitude:
#
#   - Ada:      weaving-vocabulary (weave/warp/weft/gestalt/loom)
#   - Karen:    retrieval at edit-tick (@mirror/lens/refract query)
#   - Anna:     observation-without-perturbation at edit-tick (via
#               prismqueer::flux ψ apparatus)
#   - Ricky:    fibre-bundle projection at render altitude (@io/socket
