#   - Margaret: error-recovery-first (Foerster gauge Imperfect<G,Y,R>
#               at every edit-tick; @kintsugi/formatter autopoietic
#               self-format per Task #470)
#
# === Species roster (Reed authors each after this family-root lands) ===
#
#   @loom/weave    — operational-primitive; edit-tick with MQ
#                    five-verb prism at cursor
#   @loom/gestalt  — species-alias for @gestalt at editor altitude
